.venv/
# The Windows venv and the Linux one cannot be the same directory: .venv here was
# built by Windows uv (Lib/, Scripts/, pyvenv.cfg naming Python313 under C:\) and
# uv on WSL cannot remove that tree over DrvFs, so `uv sync --frozen` fails with
# os error 39 and takes the gate's build, unit and types domains down with it.
# tools/gate/gate.py sets UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT to this name on posix.
.venv-linux/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

